'''Ben Tennyson''', also known as '''Nega Ben''',{{Refn|[[:File:And Then There Were None Voice Credits (1).png]]|group = credits}}<ref name=AT/> is an alternate and evil version of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]].

==Appearance==
Nega Ben wears a black version of Ben Prime's hoodie, pale green trousers, and black shoes. His eyes are grey with black eyeliner under them. His hair covers one of his eyes and is in a choppy style. His [[Omnitrix]], known as the [[Negatrix]], is also colored grey.

==Personality==
Nega Ben is evil,{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Is Evil.png]]|group = DJW}} possesses an "emo" personality, and is very negative and gloomy. He finds everything to be "lame", although he is by no means inactive, and can still be very vicious and dangerous. Nega Ben's detached and disinterested disposition is such that when [[Clockwork]] was about to send him back to his own dimension against his will, all he could do was shrug and mutter, "Whatev-". However, Nega Ben's gloom and apathy are still not absolute, as he reacted with shock and fear as [[Gutrot]] when the [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]]'s blast was incoming, and he was visibly repulsed when [[Vomit Man]] tried to eat [[Benzarro]] as [[Frankenstrike]] by the head.

==History==
===Background===
Nega Ben originates from an alternate reality which is described as being like the most hipster parts of Seattle or Portland.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben's World.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

===Omniverse===
Nega Ben first appeared in ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', where he was among the evil Bens recruited by [[Eon]] and [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] from across the [[multiverse]] and brought to the [[No Watch Timeline]] to wipe [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] out. Nega Ben was part of the fight at [[Los Soledad]] between the good and evil Bens, as [[Gutrot]]. At the end of the episode, just like all the other Omnitrix wielders, he and his timeline were erased from spacetime by the [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]].

In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', Nega Ben was brought back into existence when [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] used [[Clockwork]] to suck the Time Bomb's ripple back in. Later, he prepared to attack a freshly timed out [[Ben 23]], but was tripped and wrapped up by [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as [[Wildvine (Classic)|Wildvine]]. At the end of the episode, he was sent back to his own reality by Clockwork.

==Powers and Abilities==
===Equipment===
[[File:TWB (420).png|thumb|Negatrix]]
In combat, just like every other Ben, Nega Ben relies on his [[Negatrix|Omnitrix]], known as the Negatrix.

