==Etymology==
Nega is defined as "denoting the negative counterpart of a unit of measurement, in particular a unit of energy saved as a result of conservation measures." It has become a common word used to describe an evil version of a character from another universe, such as the villain [https://darkwingduck.fandom.com/wiki/Negaduck_(character) Negaduck] from the ''[[Wikipedia: Darkwing Duck|Darkwing Duck]]'' animated series.

==Trivia==
*Nega Ben likes kale chips and espresso smoothies.{{Refn|[[:File:Alternate Ben Food Preferences.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Nega Ben does not fight villains or use the Negatrix for personal gain.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Negatrix Use.png]]|group = DJW}} In fact, he does literally nothing with his Negatrix.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Negatrix Use 2.png]]|group = DJW}}
*If Nega Ben had access to [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]], he wouldn't even bother to argue with [[Bellicus]] and [[Serena]]. He would just mock or ignore them.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Alien X.png]]|group = DJW}}
*If Nega Ben turned into either [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] or [[Atomix]], he would retain his dour personality in either form.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben as Rath and Atomix.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Nega Ben's version of [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] is a cheerleader{{Refn|group = DJW|name = gwen}} with strawberry-blonde hair{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Gwen Hair Color.png]]|group = DJW}} of average intelligence. However, she acts less smart than she really is.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Gwen Intelligence.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Nega Ben's version of [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] is pretty jockish, has bleach blonde hair, and is well-tanned. Much like his Prime Timeline counterpart, Kevin is dating Gwen.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Kevin.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Nega Ben's version of [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] and the [[Galvan (Classic)|Galvan]] race were wiped out after the creation of the [[Negatrix]] by a rogue [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]] coerced by [[Maltruant]].{{Refn|[[:File:Negaverse Galvans Extinct.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]]'s favorite alternate Ben was either Nega Ben or [[Benzarro]]. However, his favorites changed depending on his mood.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Favorite Ben.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Nega Ben does not think '''[[Sumo Slammers (Classic)|Sumo Slammers]]''' are lame, but he only buys the expensive Japanese ones.{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Sumo Slammers.png]]|group = DJW}}

